      "BatchNorm2d(128)",
      "LeakyReLU(0.2)",
      "Conv2d(128,1,kernel_size=7,stride=1,padding=0,bias=True) -> [B,1,1,1] -> logit [B]",
      "no Sigmoid: BCEWithLogitsLoss is used"
